你说为什么腰带能给一条小裙子增加这么多风格亮点？

18
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,480
Like you already know you'd see this skirt styled on pinterest.
你一看就知道，这种裙子会出现在 Pinterest 的搭配图上。

19
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:17,840
I'm also really happy that if it's lowrise because y'all know I don't like high rise.
我也很高兴它是低腰的，你们知道我不喜欢高腰。

20
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:21,480
And it's because listen oh my gosh ignore the fact that my thumb is peeling.
原因是——先忽略一下我正在脱皮的拇指。

21
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:26,000
